#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_numbering.rst:7
msgid "Conductor numbering"
msgstr "导师编号"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_numbering.rst:9
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows an automatic codification of `conductors`_. This feature"
" is very useful for the creation of `reports`_, `conductor list`_, and for "
"the identification of `conductors`_ at the physical systems and `schemas`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech允许自动编译 `导体 <conductors_>`_。这个特性对于创建 `报告 <reports_>`_，`导体列表 "
"<conductor list_>`_，以及在物理系统中识别 `导体 <conductors_>`_ 和 `schemas <schemas_>`_ "
"非常有用。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_numbering.rst:13
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows the definition of multiples auto numbering patterns. It "
"also provides many flexibility on the creation of auto numbering patterns "
"using text, variables and sequential numbers."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许定义多元的汽车编号模式，也为使用文本，变量和顺序数字创建汽车编号模式提供了许多灵活性。"

